flowchart LR
  FE[React SPA via nginx] --> GW[API Gateway]
  GW --> US[User Service]
  GW --> PS[Payment Service]
  GW --> TS[Tuition Service]
  PS -- REST reserve/commit/release --> TS
  PS -- REST issue/verify --> OTP[OTP Service]
  PS -- outbox relay: XADD payment.completed --> RS
  OTP -- XADD otp.requested --> RS
  RS -- XREADGROUP / XACK --> NS[Notification Service] --> SMTP[(SMTP)]
  OTP -- OTP keys with TTL --> R
  US --> DB1[(MySQL users_db)]
  PS --> DB2[(MySQL payments_db)]
  TS --> DB3[(MySQL tuition_db)]
  subgraph REDIS [Redis 7 - AOF on]
    R[(OTP store)]
    RS[(Streams: events:*)]
  end
